{"source_id": "unknown", "subject_summary": "An academic who, after two years at Oxford, decided in 2020 to apply to PhD programmes, ultimately pursued a fully-funded PhD at Leiden University while building an academic and leadership profile.", "nodes": [{"id": "n1", "type": "start_state", "label": "Two years at Oxford before considering PhD options", "phase": 0, "evidence": "After spending two years in Oxford and entering into what seemed like an interminable pandemic, I needed a change of scenery and financial stability.", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n2", "type": "goal", "label": "Pursue a suitable doctorate degree", "phase": 0, "evidence": "When I first considered a doctorate degree in 2020, I had more questions than answers and felt incredibly scared of making the wrong choice of PhD programme.", "certainty": "implied"}, {"id": "n3", "type": "action", "label": "Considers doctorate degree in 2020", "phase": 1, "evidence": "When I first considered a doctorate degree in 2020, I had more questions than answers and felt incredibly scared of making the wrong choice of PhD programme.", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n4", "type": "action", "label": "Applies to several PhD degrees across Europe", "phase": 1, "evidence": "I applied to several PhD degrees across Europe", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n5", "type": "milestone", "label": "Accepted into PhD programmes at Oxford and Leiden", "phase": 2, "evidence": "and was accepted into two programmes, at Oxford University (Department of International Development) and Leiden University (Faculty of Governance and Global Affairs).", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n6", "type": "action", "label": "Chooses fully-funded PhD in Security and Global Affairs at Leiden", "phase": 3, "evidence": "I eventually chose to go for a fully-funded doctoral programme in Security and Global Affairs at Leiden University in The Netherlands.", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n7", "type": "obstacle", "label": "Fear of wrong PhD choice and need for change and stability", "phase": 3, "evidence": "When I first considered a doctorate degree in 2020, I had more questions than answers and felt incredibly scared of making the wrong choice of PhD programme.

After spending two years in Oxford and entering into what seemed like an interminable pandemic, I needed a change of scenery and financial stability.", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n8", "type": "outcome", "label": "Finds freedom and flourishing in Leiden PhD", "phase": 4, "evidence": "In the end, I am so glad I made that choice because it truly enabled me to flourish not only as a researcher but also as a person.", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n9", "type": "milestone", "label": "Uses flexible and supportive environment to explore parallel activities", "phase": 4, "evidence": "Being able to pursue my PhD degree while having a flexible and supportive work environment allowed me to explore all sorts of parallel activities, from entrepreneurship to leadership, and to travel extensively.", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n10", "type": "milestone", "label": "Wins two prestigious scholarships during PhD", "phase": 5, "evidence": "While pursuing my PhD, I had the chance to:
- win two prestigious scholarships", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n11", "type": "milestone", "label": "Completes two-year policy and leadership course at Oxford", "phase": 5, "evidence": "- complete a two-year policy and leadership course based at Oxford University, United Kingdom", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n12", "type": "milestone", "label": "Completes one‑month fully-funded research residency at University of Oslo", "phase": 5, "evidence": "- complete a fully-funded research residency of one month at the University of Oslo, Norway", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n13", "type": "milestone", "label": "Leads research lab of 9 doctoral researchers", "phase": 5, "evidence": "- lead a research lab of 9 doctoral researchers", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n14", "type": "milestone", "label": "Writes and publishes 5 scientific papers", "phase": 5, "evidence": "- write and publish 5 scientific papers", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n15", "type": "milestone", "label": "Speaks at 22 international conferences and events", "phase": 5, "evidence": "- speak at 22 international conferences and events", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n16", "type": "milestone", "label": "Teaches 600+ undergraduate students", "phase": 5, "evidence": "- teach 600+ undergraduate students", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n17", "type": "milestone", "label": "Travels to 15 countries during PhD", "phase": 5, "evidence": "- travel to 15 countries", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n18", "type": "milestone", "label": "Starts the blog", "phase": 5, "evidence": "- start this blog!", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n19", "type": "obstacle", "label": "Experiences ups and downs and lack of support during individual PhD project", "phase": 5, "evidence": "The journey was filled with ups and downs, as you might imagine. It can be difficult to feel supported, especially when working on an individual project and being part of a very large institution.", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n20", "type": "obstacle", "label": "Receives constant negative feedback and criticism as PhD candidate", "phase": 5, "evidence": "As PhD candidates, we constantly receive negative feedback and criticism, which can be crushing for your confidence and self-esteem.", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n21", "type": "action", "label": "Speaks to current and former PhD students and trusts own decisions", "phase": 6, "evidence": "What helped me most was speaking to current and former PhD students, as well as trusting my own decisions.", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n22", "type": "outcome", "label": "Completes PhD", "phase": 7, "evidence": "Now, having completed my PhD, I hope this guide can offer others the kind of advice I wish I heard early on!", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n23", "type": "milestone", "label": "Residency at ARENA Centre for European Studies in Oslo via RENPET scholarship", "phase": 5, "evidence": "I had the opportunity of staying in Oslo for a residency at the ARENA Centre for European Studies thanks to a scholarship from the RENPET Network, an alliance of ten universities fostering research on EU foreign policy.", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n24", "type": "milestone", "label": "Conducts interviews with Norwegian government officials during Oslo residency", "phase": 5, "evidence": "I outline the research project I worked on while in Oslo and explain why it was useful to conduct interviews with Norwegian government officials.", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n25", "type": "milestone", "label": "Places Oslo project within broader doctoral dissertation framework", "phase": 5, "evidence": "I then place it in the broader framework of my doctoral dissertation and reflect on the wonderful experience I had in Oslo", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n26", "type": "outcome", "label": "Becomes Oxford graduate and academic coach", "phase": 8, "evidence": "valuable insights from my own personal experience as an Oxford graduate and academic coach.", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n27", "type": "action", "label": "Helps many students with PhD applications, including competitive programmes at Oxford", "phase": 8, "evidence": "I have helped many students in their application process and supported their acceptance in competitive programmes such as at Oxford University after doing so myself.", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n28", "type": "outcome", "label": "Builds decade-long academic experience leading research projects and teams", "phase": 8, "evidence": "My experience builds on a decade in academia and numerous experiences leading research projects and working in teams of ambitious individuals seeking to make a difference to this world, without sacrificing their health and happiness.", "certainty": "stated"}, {"id": "n29", "type": "outcome", "label": "PhD journey described as incredible, realising aspirations and meeting fantastic scholars", "phase": 8, "evidence": "My PhD journey has been incredible. I had the chance to realise all my aspirations and meet fantastic scholars along the way.", "certainty": "stated"}], "edges": [{"source": "n1", "target": "n3", "relation": "then"}, {"source": "n3", "target": "n4", "relation": "then"}, {"source": "n4", "target": "n5", "relation": "then"}, {"source": "n5", "target": "n6", "relation": "then"}, {"source": "n6", "target": "n8", "relation": "then"}, {"source": "n8", "target": "n9", "relation": "then"}, {"source": "n9", "target": "n10", "relation": "then"}, {"source": "n10", "target": "n11", "relation": "then"}, {"source": "n11", "target": "n12", "relation": "then"}, {"source": "n12", "target": "n13", "relation": "then"}, {"source": "n13", "target": "n14", "relation": "then"}, {"source": "n14", "target": "n15", "relation": "then"}, {"source": "n15", "target": "n16", "relation": "then"}, {"source": "n16", "target": "n17", "relation": "then"}, {"source": "n17", "target": "n18", "relation": "then"}, {"source": "n18", "target": "n19", "relation": "then"}, {"source": "n19", "target": "n20", "relation"